Z||000006||FLASHY||05-11-2001||12:45 PM||||Yes my friends, that IS a sticker on the sail windows. It's a vinyl sticker I had custom made for me. It's based on a self portrait painting I did in Art College a while back. It's my signature I guess you could say.<P>Here's what the painting looked like (left) and the conversion to sticker format (right).<P>I know it doesn't appeal to many people's taste and I don't mind that at all. It's more a personal thing anyway. Us art students are "trained" to take criticism.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/customsticker.jpg"> <P>Ooops! Forgot to post the pic.<p>[This message has been edited by FLASHY (edited 05-11-2001).]||||reg||1
